{
  "order": 27000,
  "name": "Move",
  "kind": "function",
  "responsibility": "Moves a whole board, every variant, former name and id, into another repository's vault: the target note first, then each rewritten drill-down, the source note deleted last",
  "description": "ADR 0051, TASK-472.15. Holds the board's lease in the source vault, then its name's lease in the target without waiting. checks.ts refuses a same repository, a taken name and a link needing an untracked identity; drill-downs.ts rewrites the links in both vaults. checkedMove runs those checks and rewrites in memory, reading the board through the reader its caller gives it (under the lease by default), and the move writes what it found; Move preview runs it alone. A move that stopped part way leaves the board in both vaults, and running it again finishes it. It gives back the claim it ran under.",
